## 2. Brand Strategy & Core Info

* **Account Name / Identity:** `badri.hania.eg` (Associated with Mazaj and Tiago).
* **Industry / Niche:** Food & Beverage / Specialty Coffee Shop & Casual Dining.
* **Core Product or Service Offered:** Specialty espresso/iced coffee line, signature mocktails, gourmet casual sandwiches (cold cuts, tacos), and premium desserts/chocolates.
* **Target Audience:** Young adults, sports enthusiasts, students, and social groups seeking an energetic, modern hangout spot with high-quality casual dining.
* **Main Value Proposition / Core Message:** Curating an elevated mood ("Mazaj") and communal energy by delivering premium, comforting casual fare alongside specialty drinks, heavily anchored in national pride and community gathering hubs.